;==============================================================================
; icons16.asm — IC1 true 16x16 item icons (game.md §8.11 Q5). GENERATED by
; tools/icons16.py from assets/gfx/icons/<name>.grid: do not hand-edit.
;
; 43 icons x 32 B = 1376 B raw, 1 bit, NO mask, no attributes in this table.
; Per icon: rows 0..15 top-down, each row = left byte, right byte; bit 7 = leftmost
; pixel; set = ink, clear = paper. COPY (not OR) into 2x2 byte-aligned cells.
; Index = type - IT_BAG_LO (0..38); 39 + worn slot = empty-slot placeholders
; (weapon, armour, helmet, charm). Address = icons16 + index * 32.
; Ink per icon = it_tab (src/lowram.asm; source tools/items_model.py ITEM_INK) with
; paper black (cursor: paper blue); placeholders ink $05. Ink is listed per icon
; below for reference only; the draw takes it from it_tab.
; 1 ink per 16x16 icon -> each 8x8 cell is ink + paper: clash-free by construction.
;==============================================================================
ICONS16_W       EQU 16
ICONS16_H       EQU 16
ICONS16_BYTES   EQU 32              ; per icon
ICONS16_COUNT   EQU 43              ; 39 bag types + 4 placeholders
ICONS16_PH      EQU 39              ; first placeholder index (39 + worn slot)
ICONS16_INK_PH  EQU $05             ; placeholder ink (dim cyan)

